BT 1 0 0 1 0 49.5 Tm /F1 10.5 Tf 15 TL 1.264366 Tw (Travel agencies handle a large amount of information every day: customer details, tour packages,) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.272605 Tw (seat availability, bookings, payments and cancellations. When this data is maintained manually on) Tj T* 0 Tw .635174 Tw (paper or in scattered spreadsheets, it leads to duplicate entries, overbooking, calculation errors and) Tj T* 0 Tw (slow service.) Tj T* ET
