BT 1 0 0 1 0 64.5 Tm .10448 Tw 15 TL /F2 10.5 Tf 0 0 0 rg (Travel Agency Management) Tj /F1 10.5 Tf ( is a console-based application developed in C++ that automates these) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.790097 Tw (day-to-day operations. The system allows an agency to maintain a catalogue of domestic and) Tj T* 0 Tw -0.137895 Tw (international tour packages, register customers, book seats, accept payments, cancel bookings with a) Tj T* 0 Tw -0.028779 Tw (refund, and generate summary reports. All records are stored in text files so that data is retained after) Tj T* 0 Tw (the program is closed.) Tj T* ET
